# --- .NET / spike build output ---
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# --- Node / diagrams-as-code tooling ---
node_modules/

# --- OS / editor noise ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Local-only scratch & private companions ---
# *.local.md = personal gaps / notes (e.g. CLAUDE.local.md), not for public eyes.
# NOTE: .gitignore has no inline comments — the # must start the line, or it becomes part of the pattern.
*.local.md
scratch/
_private/

# --- Private / sensitive study artifacts (kept local, not pushed) ---
# Drill SCORED RECORDS deliberately surface weak spots — not for a public repo.
# Keep the public protocol/rubric/tooling (_drills/README.md, template.md, tooling.md);
# ignore only the numbered records (_drills/0001-*.md etc.).
_drills/[0-9]*.md

# Keep empty structural dirs (spike/, _sources/) via their .gitkeep files.
# Study artifacts — decision cards, ADRs, READMEs, journal — ARE tracked.
# (Drill scored records are the deliberate exception above.)
